WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.002
This is the call
that started it all.

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.903
SISTER:<i>  Mom fell
 and I think she broke her hip.</i>

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.705
<i> The ambulance is on the way.</i>

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.440
(SIREN WAILS)

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:09.409
STEVE BURROWS:<i> When my mom
 went into the hospital</i>

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.477
<i> for a routine
 partial hip replacement,</i>

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.146
<i> we knew something was wrong.
 The neurologist told us,</i>

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:16.783
<i> "Your mom is in a coma."
 And now it's brutally clear.</i>

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.685
<i> I need a lawyer.</i>

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:23.423
MAN:<i> We have not even begun
 to recognize</i>

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.658
<i> the country's third leading
 cause of death,</i>

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:26.993
medical care gone wrong.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:30.363
The medical profession needs to
be accountable for the errors.

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:33.666
These are our costs.
421,000 dollars.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.701
<i> Meds, health insurance, taxes.</i>

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.570
<i> All roads lead
 to the insurance company.</i>

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.807
<i> Their whole plan is
 to drag this out</i>

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:41.941
<i> as long as they can.</i>

00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:43.275
WOMAN: (OVER PHONE)
<i> You're a lawyer, am I correct?</i>

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:45.010
No, I'm a comedy director.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.781
This is taking over our lives.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:51.451
Problems in health care
continue to be endemic.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.385
<i> We're not learning
 from our mistakes.</i>

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:54.487
BURROWS:<i> Something has to change</i>

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.389
<i> so this doesn't keep
 happening to people.</i>

